From: sbwml <admin@cooluc.com>
Subject: [PATCH] r8125: disable Energy Efficient Ethernet (EEE) by default

Adapt the upstream build option to the ImmortalWrt package recipe.

Upstream: https://github.com/sbwml/package_kernel_r8125/commit/93d4735e5ef2f6bac9cc887a8f633013d6f5f08b
Signed-off-by: sbwml <admin@cooluc.com>
Signed-off-by: Lovin Yarn <juanshengyuan@gmail.com>
---
--- a/package/kernel/r8125/Makefile
+++ b/package/kernel/r8125/Makefile
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@
 	+$(KERNEL_MAKE) $(PKG_JOBS) \
 		M="$(PKG_BUILD_DIR)/src" \
 		CONFIG_ASPM=n \
+		ENABLE_EEE=n \
 		ENABLE_MULTIPLE_TX_QUEUE=y \
 		ENABLE_RSS_SUPPORT=y \
 		modules
